# Vigil Support / DB Copilot — Focus Spec

**Status:** SPEC / PLANNING ONLY — no implementation until the user starts execution.  
**Why:** Vigil is not only for coders. **Technical support** (and later PMs) need AI that can **see live databases** — especially **SQL Server** and **PostgreSQL** — instead of the painful loop: explain schema → AI guesses SQL → paste into SSMS → fail → re-explain. Cursor has no first-class “login to SQL Server and work on the live catalog.” This is a Vigil differentiator.  
**Related:** `.cursor/rules/03-عقد-مشروع-الويب.mdc`, `.cursor/rules/02-جسر-السحابة-الموحد.mdc`, `.cursor/rules/00-الخطة-العامة-والأولويات.mdc`, `.cursor/rules/01-وضع-التخطيط-Plan-Mode.mdc`

