## 1. Personas & surfaces

| Persona | Primary need | Coding IDE? |
|---------|--------------|-------------|
| **Developer** | Repo agent, Plan Mode, LSP, deep index | Yes (desktop) |
| **Technical support / DBA-lite** | Connect to customer/company SQL, diagnose, write/fix queries, tickets, reports | No — needs **DB Copilot** |
| **Project manager** (later) | Status, plans, digests, risk notes tied to projects | No — web shell + light tools |

**Product rule:** One Vigil **account / wallet / chat history** (Firestore). Different **workspaces / modes** in the shell:
- **Code workspace** (repo) — existing desktop strength  
- **Support / DB workspace** — live SQL connections + schema-aware chat  
- **PM workspace** (later)

Web sidebar should eventually expose entry points (e.g. **Support**, **Connections**, or Projects typed as `code | support | pm`). Desktop embeds the same web where useful, but **live DB sockets run where the network allows** (see §3).

