### 7.5 Crystal Reports ↔ Database linkage (high addiction value)

Full Crystal designer is **out of scope**. Vigil becomes the **daily companion** around reports + SQL:

- [ ] **Report binder:** register a report (name, `.rpt` path or export of Command/SQL, parameters list, module/customer) linked to a connection profile + suspected tables/views  
- [ ] **“لي التقرير غلط؟” wizard:** pick report → Vigil runs/adapts its SQL (or user-pasted Command) on live DB → compares row counts / null keys / date filters vs parameters  
- [ ] **Column mismatch detector:** report fields vs live result columns / aliases — highlight missing or renamed fields (classic Crystal break)  
- [ ] **Parameter playground:** set `@FromDate`, `@Branch`, … once; re-run dataset; pin “golden” vs “broken” result samples into chat/ticket  
- [ ] **Explain totals:** “المجموع في التقرير غير دفتر الأستاذ” → AI proposes join/filter checks against live schema  
- [ ] **Report catalog (team Library):** searchable list of company reports + last known-good SQL + owner — tribal knowledge that usually lives in WhatsApp  
- [ ] **Ticket from report:** one click → Ticket Composer prefilled with report name, params, SQL, mismatch notes  
- [ ] Optional later: parse `.rpt` metadata where feasible; until then accept SQL/Command paste + field list

